<span class="line">        center为<span class="token tag"><span class="token tag"><span class="token punctuation">&lt;</span>strong</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></span>0‑1归一化纹理坐标，不是画布像素！<span class="token tag"><span class="token tag"><span class="token punctuation">&lt;/</span>strong</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></span><span class="token tag"><span class="token tag"><span class="token punctuation">&lt;</span>br</span><span class="token punctuation">/&gt;</span></span></span>
